<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n99736" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνδια-τρίβω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pass</i> or <i>spend</i> time <i>with</i> or
				<i>together</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σὺν . . Κίμωνι
				αἰῶνα πάντα ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Cratin.
				1.5
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν ἄλλον ς. χρόνον</span>
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῖς τεθνηκόσι</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				53.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> more freq.
			without acc., <i>live constantly with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μετά τινος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				172c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				2.27
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Vit.Philonid.</u>
				p.12
			</span></i> C.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ τῷ Σωκράτει
				συνδιατρίβοντες</span> his disciples, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.2.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.1.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of things,
				<i>occupy oneself with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύθοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					4.158
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				2.43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				9.76
			</span></i>.</div>
